sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant GW as Gateway<br/>(Istio/kGateway)<br/>80/TCP HTTP
    participant EPP as Endpoint Picker<br/>9002/TCP gRPC
    participant Redis as Redis<br/>8100/TCP
    participant RP as Routing Proxy<br/>(Decode Sidecar)<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Decode as vLLM Decode<br/>8001/TCP HTTP
    participant Prefill as vLLM Prefill<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HF as Hugging Face Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Client,Decode: Flow 1: Inference Request (Prefill-Decode with KV Transfer)
        Client->>GW: POST / (inference request)<br/>HTTP, No Auth
        GW->>EPP: ext_proc request<br/>gRPC :9002, No TLS
        EPP->>Redis: KV-cache lookup<br/>TCP :8100, No Auth
        Redis-->>EPP: Cache hit/miss + scoring data
        EPP-->>GW: Routing decision<br/>(selected backend)
        GW->>RP: Forward to decode pod<br/>HTTP :8000, No TLS
        RP->>Decode: Proxy request<br/>HTTP :8001
        Decode->>Prefill: NixL KV transfer<br/>TCP :5557, No TLS
        Prefill-->>Decode: KV-cache data
        Decode-->>RP: Inference response
        RP-->>GW: Response
        GW-->>Client: JSON Response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Client,HF: Flow 2: Model Deployment via ModelService CR
        Client->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply ModelService CR<br/>HTTPS :443, Bearer Token
        K8sAPI->>K8sAPI: Store ModelService resource
        Note over K8sAPI: Controller watches ModelService CRs
        K8sAPI-->>K8sAPI: Controller reconciles
        K8sAPI->>K8sAPI: Create Deployments, Services,<br/>InferencePool, InferenceModel
        Note over Prefill,Decode: Pods start
        Prefill->>HF: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS :443, Bearer HF_TOKEN
        HF-->>Prefill: Model weights
        Decode->>HF: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS :443, Bearer HF_TOKEN
        HF-->>Decode: Model weights
    end
